<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><div><h1>Communication</h1><p class="muted">Announcements, notices and school messaging.</p></div><div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/communication/inbox">Inbox</a> <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/communication/create">New communication</a></div></div>
